51dd7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1cfa6812/uploads/origins/fee51edb-ddbd-44b4-a7a2-230d7bad6e49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25c0cd37d7ce8a618adf15fa90e5b395 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello midori-san! I'm Silver, nice to meet you 👋\nI saw your art on tumblr and I like your style and how you draw animal ears, so I'd like to make a request 🙏\n\nI'd like you to draw my OC, Okita Celeritas (オキタ・セレリタス). You can choose her outfit and how you draw her, I leave it up to your choice. I trust your taste and compositions\n\nOkita (オキタ): https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15gvERlE-htup9Jqg8QuIjieEDxtQXK_4?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for considering my request 💗", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}